        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Miré el bolsillo y no tenía el celular.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Olhei o bolso e não estava com o celular.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/9fd84d6c3f0742509245647b4d66b9ed_b04-mire-el-bolsillo-y-no-tenia-el-celular.mp3?Expires=1794099684&Signature=o2yNqQVLfouRujasBOS5KoDCKxhMQ-5g0ugfKtnIEhFd0dhtP7DRMEtovzUdWHhLyC2YiK83SaHLdcok~zqE8G1VFNOYKM6m3lb0oO9cR7mm8ao5gKWE8f77Wr5dv8GImRFi-M8vwRI-Nu8IBaGy6FnsCGe-3VhAnMmu3VwvgsdVWUR~v4nFyOU6Mz820jNldpM~R88hcrMfjjFYkxAWGxrbtb84xhdaYBOhJHz0q11-tTRfXcvP2E4~tSiIYrt~X2lgXzRGQng4l5MV4aMNiuHuVaQk55dS9B72fhqHHMSWp2~imFF7fWA29WpQCRxlUbZM9bLBdP18huPhKnI8lw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
